{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Vacchagotta","html":"<article id='thag1.112'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.112 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.112 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dvādasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Twelve </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Vacchagottattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Vacchagotta </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Tevijjohaṁ mahājhāyī, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I am a master of the three knowledges, <j>I’m a great meditator, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>cetosamathakovido; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>an expert in serenity of heart. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sadattho me anuppatto, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve realized my heart’s goal </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kataṁ buddhassa sāsanan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and fulfilled the Buddha’s instructions. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Vacchagotto thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
